You nailed it by posting this, Bryan—and I can **see the issue clear as day** now:

---

### 🚨 Culprit Spotted: These Numbers Are Not Part of Your Code

This:

```tsx
24  &lt;TabsContent value=&quot;dashboard&quot;&gt;
25    &lt;Card&gt;
26      &lt;CardContent className=&quot;space-y-4&quot;&gt;
...
```

Those **`24`, `25`, `26`, etc.`** — if they&#x27;re actually showing **inside your app UI**, and not just in your code editor — then guess what?

### ❌ You&#x27;re Rendering This Text Block **Literally**
Somehow those **numbered lines got pasted in** as **text content**, not just for your eyes in the editor.

---

### 🧼 THE FIX: Delete Those Line Numbers!

Make sure your actual code looks like this, **without the numbers at the beginning**:

✅ **Correct Version:**
```tsx
&lt;TabsContent value=&quot;dashboard&quot;&gt;
  &lt;Card&gt;
    &lt;CardContent className=&quot;space-y-4&quot;&gt;
      &lt;h2 className=&quot;text-2xl font-semibold&quot;&gt;Life Goals &amp; Strategic Timeline&lt;/h2&gt;
